==Information==
===Format===
* '''First Phase''' 
** 8 groups of 4 players
** Each group plays a double-elimination bracket (also known as a ''[[starcraft2:Dual_Tournament_Format|GSL-Style Group stage]]'')
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 2 players}} advance to the Second Phase
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated

* '''Second Phase''' 
** 4 groups of 4 players (GSL Style)
** Each group plays a double-elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 2 players}} advance to the Third Phase
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for details about the Seeding''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-top:10px;">
The members of each pool are assigned as follows:
* Phase 2 Group A:
**Phase 1 Group A & Group B first place
**Phase 1 Group C & Group D second place
* Phase 2 Group B:
**Phase 1 Group C & Group D first place
**Phase 1 Group A & Group B second place
* Phase 2 Group C:
**Phase 1 Group E & Group F first place
**Phase 1 Group G & Group H second place
* Phase 2 Group D:
**Phase 1 Group G & Group H first place
**Phase 1 Group E & Group F second place
</div>

*'''Third Phase''' 
** Single-elimination bracket 
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft5}}
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for details about the Seeding''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-top:10px;">
The first round of matches are assigned as follows:
*Phase 2 Group A first place vs Group D second place
*Phase 2 Group B first place vs Group C second place
*Phase 2 Group C first place vs Group B second place
*Phase 2 Group D first place vs Group A second place
</div>

