==Format==
* '''First Phase''' 
** 12 groups of 4 players
** Each group plays a double-elimination bracket (also known as a ''[[starcraft2:Dual_Tournament_Format|GSL-Style Group stage]]'')
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Group winners}} advance to the Third Phase
** {{bgcolortext|stay|Group runner-ups}} advance to the Second Phase
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated

* '''Second Phase''' 
** 4 groups of 3 players
** Single round-robin
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Group winners}} advance to the Third Phase
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated
**{{Collapsible rules|1|title=Click here for details about tiebreaker and seeding|texts=
The members of each pool are assigned as follows: 

* Phase 2 Group A:
**Phase 1 Group A, B & C second place
* Phase 2 Group B:
**Phase 1 Group D, E & F second place
* Phase 2 Group C:
**Phase 1 Group G, H & I second place
* Phase 2 Group D:
**Phase 1 Group J, K & L second place
<br/>
Should a situation arise where no Player holds the highest number of Set wins (tie), all Matches played within that specific group will be played again. After that, the results of all involved Players will be compared taking into account all Matches played in both Round Robin runs.

# Set wins
# Game win-loss difference
# Round win-loss difference
# Head-to-head
# Game win-loss difference in Phase 1
# Round win-loss difference in Phase 1
}}
*'''Third Phase''' 
** Single-elimination bracket 
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft5}}
**{{Collapsible rules|2|title=Click here for details about the seeding|texts=
* Phase 1 Group A Winner vs Phase 2 Group D winner
* Phase 1 Group B winner vs Phase 1 Group C winner
* Phase 1 Group D winner vs Phase 2 Group C winner
* Phase 1 Group E winner vs Phase 1 Group F winner
* Phase 1 Group G winner vs Phase 2 Group B winner
* Phase 1 Group H winner vs Phase 1 Group I winner
* Phase 1 Group J winner vs Phase 2 Group A winner
* Phase 1 Group K winner vs Phase 1 Group L winner
}}

