==Format==
* '''First Phase''' 
** 4 groups of 8 players
** Each group plays a double-elimination bracket (also known as a ''[[starcraft2:Dual_Tournament_Format|GSL-Style Group stage]]'')
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 4 players}} per group advance to Stage 2
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated

* '''Second Phase''' 
** 2 groups of 8 players (GSL Style)
** Each group plays a double-elimination bracket
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft3}}
** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 4 players}} per group advance to the Playoffs
** {{bgcolortext|down|Remaining players}} are eliminated

*'''Third Phase''' 
** Single-elimination bracket 
** All matches are {{Abbr/Ft5}}

